dialogue("Welcome to the dungeon, traveler. The air is cold, the halls are dark, and something is waiting below.");
dialogue("You have a sword, a shield, and a little courage. Find the key, open the final door, and escape.");
dialogue("Press E to interact, Z to attack, I for your inventory, and ESC for the menu. Good luck.");
end();
